// Night outside the Nordhamn Arena. Every firm you have beaten this season is back for one last go,
// united under THE GENERAL. Map generated by a scratch script (rect fills); see the area notes below.
//
// Route (start bottom-right, finish top-left into the arena):
//   ARENA WAY (road, burnt-out car)            enc 'approach'
//   -> POLICE VAN GAUNTLET (van slalom)        enc 'gauntlet'
//   -> ARENA PLAZA (giant crest, fountains, statues, fireworks)   enc 'plaza' (4 waves incl. THE REUNION)
//      side: POLICE COMPOUND (vans, scarf on a van roof) -> TICKET OFFICE (optional enc 'touts',
//            fake panel -> storeroom with the PIN BADGE on a filing cabinet)
//      secret: boarded-up hoarding in the arena facade -> nook -> the PITCH (pitch invasion!)
//   -> STAIR PLAZA up to the gates              enc 'stairs'
//   -> ARENA FORECOURT: BOSS THE GENERAL (3 phases) -> the arena gates open -> through the tunnel onto the pitch.
